### ---------- >>> Release machinery <<< ---------- ###
# Transient scratch file from the `make release-<level>` changelog roll. Only
# ever present if awk or mv died mid-rewrite; it must never be committed.
CHANGELOG.md.tmp

# Release notes extracted from CHANGELOG.md by release.yml. Generated on the
# runner, but the same awk is easy to run locally when debugging the release;
# ignoring it keeps that from dirtying the tree and blocking `make release-*`.
release-notes.md
